    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61e2c76a7f4d643d2fb3a862",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见光钻相当积极地这么说道。\n然而，我现在不打算让还在新马级的她\n做负担较大的训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be011bdd235c93eed98c08af1c04896cd8cf7064d0f5f5384226c9fab285cf18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
