      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "学园魔咒其一\n“在顶楼玩翁仔标，赢了的人会在下楼时滑倒”。\n在我赶紧拿出翁仔标的同时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "858befffce63602e369b5a2a6fa1fdc6bee2d2e938c4cc3cd087617b49ecc8b1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
